			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730280101,
					"content": "看来这里也有大机器人的零件，要是让加扎里先生看到的话，估计又要掏出他的那台留影机了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280102,
					"content": "说起来，之前兰利遮说，秘密基地里的大零件是兰利遮搬过去的，该不会是真的吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280103,
					"content": "当然是真的，兰利遮不骗那菈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280104,
						730280105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰利遮"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280104,
					"content": "果然…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730280106,
					"content": "兰利遮就是当初陪着孩子们在秘密基地里玩耍的兰那罗吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280107,
					"content": "不过兰利遮也什么都不记得了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280108,
						730280109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280108,
					"content": "或许和笔记里的花有关吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730280110,
					"content": "嗯，之前无郁稠林的兰那罗把花花给我们之后，也忘记了所有的事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280111,
					"content": "或许他们三个也经历过和我们一样的冒险吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280112,
					"content": "兰利遮不知道你们说的是什么，也想不起来。不过，和小那菈玩，很开心！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰利遮"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280113,
					"content": "嗯，要一直开心哦，兰利遮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730280109,
					"content": "我们之前也遇到过…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730280110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730280105,
